{
  "$comment": "HAND-EDITED source of the Updates and Announcements settings (cx-d5b5d). scripts/cmux-next/gen-settings-sources.py writes the Swift descriptors and the parser constants (paths, defaults, ranges, choice values) from this file; schemas/settings/settings-schema.json is still exported from Swift and must not change when this file moves. Row fields: key (dotted cmux.json path), name (identifier for generated constants; default the last path part), title/help/summary {key: string catalog key, text: English}, kind (toggle | number | choice | folder_list | string_list), choices [{value, title}], range {min, max, step, unit, placeholder (default min)}, default, aliases {old value: value it loads as}, keywords, note (developer note, not shown).",
